  "notes": "The Phase 6 full tier for Shibnagar Town: 10 fictional named NPCs. Shibnagar is a town, not a district, so the cast is 10, not 25. Every character is invented for the game; no real person is depicted. profession_id resolves to data/professions.json; home_property_id and workplace_property_id resolve to data/city2-shibnagar.json (homes are residential apartment/house properties); schedule_template_id resolves to data/npc-schedules.json (a profession template, or the elder_day life-stage template for the one retired cast member). Relationship types and score ranges follow GDD-01 §6.1/§6.2; spouse edges are mirrored and parent/child edges are mirrored as child/parent. workplace_property_id is null only for the retired elder — Shibnagar has no airport, so it has no pilot, and the pilot profession is not represented in this cast. Intercity edges point at ids in data/npc-cast.json (the District 1 cast) and are recorded from the Shibnagar side only; the District 1 file carries no return edge in this unit. life_stage follows the GDD-01 §3 age bands.",
